	"Actor-DOME-Name": "雷达站",
	"Actor-DOMF-Description": "假装成一座雷达站\n其中堆满了爆炸物",
	"Actor-DOMF-Name": "雷达站模型",
	"Actor-DTRK-Attributes": "· 主动技能：引爆脏弹（部署以引爆携带的脏弹\n造成大范围伤害与核辐射区）",
	"Actor-DTRK-Description": "装载一枚大当量脏弹的轻型卡车\n典型的孤注一掷的自杀式载具",
	"Actor-DTRK-Name": "自爆卡车",
	"Actor-DTRK-Weaknesses": "· 几乎没有防御能力",
	"Actor-E1-Description": "泛用型反步兵步兵",
	"Actor-E1-Name": "步枪兵",
	"Actor-E1-Strengths": "· 强势对抗：步兵",
	"Actor-E2-Description": "携带高爆手雷的反建筑步兵",
	"Actor-E2-Name": "掷弹兵",
	"Actor-E2-Strengths": "· 强势对抗：基础建筑、防御建筑、轻甲单位",
	"Actor-E3-Description": "泛用型反装甲防空步兵",
	"Actor-E3-Name": "导弹兵",
	"Actor-E3-Strengths": "· 强势对抗：重甲单位、飞行器、基础建筑、防御建筑",
	"Actor-E3-Weaknesses": "· 弱势对抗：步兵、轻甲单位",
	"Actor-E4-Description": "配备火焰喷射器的近程反步兵反建筑步兵",
	"Actor-E4-Name": "苏联火焰兵",
	"Actor-E4-Strengths": "· 强势对抗：步兵、基础建筑",
	"Actor-E6-Name": "工程师",
	"Actor-E7-Description": "手持双枪、身背C4炸弹的盟军精英突击队员",
	"Actor-E7-Name": "谭雅",
	"Actor-E7-Strengths": "· 强势对抗：步兵、基础建筑",
	"Actor-E7-Weaknesses": "· 无法攻击飞行器",
	"Actor-E8-Description": "配备一门单兵辐射炮的反步兵特战队",
	"Actor-E8-Name": "辐射兵",
	"Actor-E8-Strengths": "· 强势对抗：步兵、轻甲单位",
	"Actor-economy.policy-Name": "战时政策：战争债券",
	"Actor-EINSTEIN-Name": "爱因斯坦博士",
	"Actor-empgren.upgrade-Name": "科技升级：电磁脉冲手雷",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.anathema-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "思金天灾教团专属的支援能力\n选定的友方载具在30秒内获得随时间增加的战斗力加成\n作用时间结束之后，该单位将不可避免地被彻底消灭\n攻击力加成的效果与选定的单位造价成反比",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.anathema-Name": "血厄死咒",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.anathema-Strengths": "· 选定的友方载具在30秒内获得随时间增加的攻击力、移动速度和攻击速度加成",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.anathema-Weaknesses": "· 作用时间结束之后，该单位将不可避免地被彻底消灭",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.defensematrix-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "源于GDI战区防卫兵的主动技能\n在一段时间内提升友方步兵的耐久度",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.defensematrix-Name": "能量矩阵",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.defensematrix-Strengths": "· 每一位防卫兵的能量矩阵可以提升步兵的伤害减免\n相当于1250等效生命值\n· 该效果最多可叠加六层",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.frenzy-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "Nod先知刻印专属的支援能力\n在一段时间内大幅提升选中单位的移动速度和攻击速度\n强化效果结束后，受影响的单位将会在较短时间内受到各项属性的惩罚",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.frenzy-Name": "战争狂热",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.gyro-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "GDI钢爪军团专属的主动技能\n需要先研发科技升级\n机甲类单位在使用该技能后，在技能持续期间以降低攻击速度为代价\n极大地提升武器射程",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.gyro-Name": "陀螺仪稳定",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.gyro-Strengths": "· 武器射程提升33%",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.gyro-Weaknesses": "· 武器攻击速度降低25%",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.hotu-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "苏联步兵集团军专属的支援能力\n将范围内至多5名 友方基础步兵擢升为苏联英雄\n所有苏联英雄获得极大幅度的伤害减免与攻击速度、移动速度提升",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.hotu-Name": "苏联英雄",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.hypercharge-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "思金寻猎者和撕裂者的专属主动技能\n需要先研发科技升级\n上述单位在主动技能持续时间内大幅提升攻击速度，但持续时间结束后大幅降低攻击力和移动速度",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.hypercharge-Name": "超级充能",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.hypercharge-Strengths": "· 攻击速度大幅提升，可以持续不断地开火",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.hypercharge-Weaknesses": "· 受到任意来源的伤害额外增加20%",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.inspiration-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "源自苏联连队政委、大型运兵车和霸王坦克的被动光环\n为周围友方基础步兵提供额外移动速度和攻击速度",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.inspiration-Name": "战地宣传 一级",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.inspiration2-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "源自苏联连队政委、大型运兵车和霸王坦克的被动光环\n为周围友方基础步兵提供更多移动速度和攻击速度",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.inspiration2-Name": "战地宣传 二级",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.ionsurge-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "思金旅行者-59专属的支援能力\n可在选定位置生成一个加速场\n在加速场持续期间穿过该区域的所有友方单位都将获得限时的高额移动速度加成",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.ionsurge-Name": "离子奔涌",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.ionsurge-Strengths": "· 移动速度提升50%",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.ironcurtain-Name": "铁幕",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.ironcurtain-Strengths": "· 获得100%的伤害减免，不会受到任何伤害",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.ironcurtain-Weaknesses": "· 移动速度上限被限制到重型坦克的水准",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.naniterepair-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "源自GDI遥控师部专属的支援能力\n在一段时间内持续修复选定区域内的友方载具",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.naniterepair-Name": "纳米修复",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.naniterepair-Strengths": "· 每秒回复受影响载具5%最大生命值的生命值",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.naniteshield-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "源自GDI防御学说（三级）的支援能力\n为范围内友方载具提供额外保护",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.naniteshield-Name": "纳米护盾",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.naniteshield-Strengths": "· 获得50%的伤害减免",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.tibstealth-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "源自Nod支援型超级武器的增益效果，选定范围内一切地面目标在24秒内隐形\n受影响的单位开火时显形\n随后可以迅速重新隐形",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.tibstealth-Name": "泰伯利亚隐形力场",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.atomized-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "源自思金收集者-73的裂解者\n降低受影响的单位的战斗力，还能使其持续损失生命值",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.atomized-Name": "裂解",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.berserk-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "源自苏联灵能军团的各类神经毒气，以及Nod的全息先知像\n受影响的单位将无法分辨敌我",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.berserk-Name": "狂乱",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.berserk-Weaknesses": "· 不由自主地攻击距离自己最近的单位",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.blinded-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "清空受影响单位的视野和攻击能力",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.blinded-Name": "致盲",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.chill-Attributes": "· 此效果最多可叠加10层",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.chill-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "源自盟军的各类急冻武器\n基于层数降低目标的移动速度并削弱目标的防护能力",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.chill-Name": "严寒",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.concussion-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "降低受影响单位的移动速度和攻击速度",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.concussion-Name": "震慑",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.emp-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "受影响的载具、重型半机械步兵以及防御建筑将完全瘫痪\n绝大部分的飞行器将直接坠毁",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.emp-Name": "电磁脉冲",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.irradiated-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "源自苏联伊拉克的辐射军团和根除者战车\n使目标对周围持续造成范围伤害，降低目标的攻击能力和防护能力",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.irradiated-Name": "辐照化",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.jammed-Name": "电子干扰",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.reapersnared-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "源自Nod半机械死神的主动技能\n受影响的步兵将完全失去战斗能力",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.reapersnared-Name": "失能",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.suppression-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "源自思金支援型超级武器、主宰以及咒术师的减益效果\n以灵能在24秒内遏制范围内的敌方单位，降低他们的机动性和战斗力",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.suppression-Name": "灵能压制",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.targetpainted-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "获取目标的位置\n使目标受到额外的伤害",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.targetpainted-Name": "标记",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.veiled-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "源自盟军的电磁干扰仪、黑鹰战机、白虎卫士，以及英国的支援能力：战争之雾\n降低受影响单位的视野和射程",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.veiled-Name": "战争之雾",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.warped-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "源自盟军德国的超时空监狱，以及德国的支援能力：时空锁定\n受影响的单位将被牢牢禁锢在时空之中",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.warped-Name": "时间锁定",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.warped-Strengths": "· 免疫非时间锁定武器的伤害\n· 免疫其他增益和减益",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.watched-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "获取目标的位置",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.watched-Name": "寄生",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.watched-Weaknesses": "· 被暴露给寄生来源",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.bh-Attributes": "· 乘员：黑手近卫军",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.bh-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "搭乘一名黑手近卫军的多功能步战车\n装有一门强大的反装甲火焰喷射器",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.bh-Name": "多功能步战车（黑手近卫军）",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.bh-Strengths": "· 强势对抗：重甲单位、轻甲单位",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.chem-Attributes": "· 乘员：半机械泰伯利亚突击兵",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.chem-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "搭乘一名半机械泰伯利亚突击兵的多功能步战车\n向外播撒泰伯利亚毒液",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.chem-Name": "多功能步战车（半机械泰伯利亚突击兵）",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.chem-Strengths": "· 强势对抗：步兵、轻甲单位、基础建筑",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.cmdo-Attributes": "· 乘员：谭雅、鲍里斯、突击队员",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.cmdo-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "搭乘一名突击队（谭雅、鲍里斯、突击队员）的多功能步战车\n以反步兵武器迅速地攻击",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.cmdo-Name": "多功能步战车（突击队）",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.cmdo-Strengths": "· 强势对抗：步兵",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.cmdo-Weaknesses": "· 无法攻击飞行器、载具、建筑",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.cmsr-Attributes": "· 乘员：连队政委",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.cmsr-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "搭乘一名连队政委的多功能步战车\n不断地鼓舞附近的友方基础步兵从而提升他们的战斗力",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.cmsr-Name": "多功能步战车（连队政委）",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.cmsr-Strengths": "· 鼓舞友方基础步兵",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.cmsr-Weaknesses": "· 无武装",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.conf-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "搭乘一名解罪司铎的多功能步战车\n发射具有致幻效果的爆炸物",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.conf-Name": "多功能步战车（解罪司铎）",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.conf-Strengths": "· 强势对抗：步兵、轻甲单位",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.cryo-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "搭乘一名急冻军团的多功能步战车\n装有一座大口径急冻喷射器",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.cryo-Name": "多功能步战车（急冻军团）",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.cryo-Strengths": "· 强势对抗：步兵、轻甲单位",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.disin-Attributes": "· 乘员：粉碎者",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.disin-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "搭乘一名粉碎者的多功能步战车\n使用粉碎光束攻击敌人",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.disin-Name": "多功能步战车（粉碎者）",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.disin-Strengths": "· 强势对抗：重甲单位、飞行器",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.disin-Weaknesses": "· 弱势对抗：步兵",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.enfo-Attributes": "· 乘员：镇暴部队",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.enfo-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "搭乘一名镇暴部队的多功能步战车\n配备重型双发霰弹枪",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.enfo-Name": "多功能步战车（镇暴部队）",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.enfo-Strengths": "· 强势对抗：步兵、轻甲单位",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.engi-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "搭乘一名工程师的多功能步战车\n可以占领建筑",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.engi-Name": "多功能步战车（工程师）",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.engi-Weaknesses": "· 无武装",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.enli-Attributes": "· 乘员：觉醒者",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.enli-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "搭乘一名觉醒者的多功能步战车觉醒者\n使用强大的粒子光束炮攻击敌人",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.enli-Name": "多功能步战车（觉醒者）",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.enli-Strengths": "· 强势对抗：重甲单位、轻甲单位",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.flame-Attributes": "· 乘员：火焰兵",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.flame-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "搭乘一名火焰兵的多功能步战车\n装有一挺强大的火焰喷射器",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.flame-Name": "多功能步战车（火焰兵）",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.flame-Strengths": "· 强势对抗：步兵、轻甲单位、基础建筑",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.ggi-Attributes": "· 乘员：重型步兵",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.ggi-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "搭乘一名重型步兵的多功能步战车\n可以发射强大的反装甲防空导弹",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.ggi-Name": "多功能步战车（重型步兵）",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.ggi-Strengths": "· 强势对抗：重甲单位、飞行器",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.ggi-Weaknesses": "· 弱势对抗：步兵",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.grenade-Attributes": "· 乘员：掷弹兵",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.grenade-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "搭乘一名掷弹兵的多功能步战车\n对外抛掷破片手雷",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.grenade-Name": "多功能步战车（掷弹兵）",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.grenade-Strengths": "· 强势对抗：基础建筑、防御建筑、轻甲单位",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.hack-Attributes": "· 乘员：黑客",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.hack-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "搭乘一名黑客的多功能步战车\n可以远程骇入劫持基础建筑和防御建筑\n乘员撤出后解除骇入劫持的效果",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.hack-Name": "多功能步战车（黑客）",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.hack-Strengths": "· 强势对抗：基础建筑、防御建筑",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.hopl-Attributes": "· 乘员：守护方阵",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.hopl-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "搭乘一名守护方阵的多功能步战车\n装有一门轻型光棱炮",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.hopl-Name": "多功能步战车（守护方阵）",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.hopl-Strengths": "· 强势对抗：步兵、轻甲单位、基础建筑",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.impl-Attributes": "· 乘员：穿刺者",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.impl-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "搭乘一名穿刺者的多功能步战车\n可以从远距离发射具备穿刺效果的弹片",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.impl-Name": "多功能步战车（穿刺者）",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.impl-Strengths": "· 强势对抗：轻甲单位、步兵",
