	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.spy-Name": "多功能步战车（间谍）",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.spy-Weaknesses": "· 无法造成伤害",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.stlk-Attributes": "· 乘员：追猎者",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.stlk-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "搭乘一名追猎者的多功能步战车\n发射反步兵离子飞镖\n并且还能隐形",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.stlk-Name": "多功能步战车（追猎者）",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.stlk-Strengths": "· 强势对抗：轻甲单位、步兵",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.tes-Attributes": "· 乘员：震电突击队、特斯拉步兵",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.tes-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "搭乘一名震电突击队或特斯拉步兵的多功能步战车\n装备小型特斯拉线圈作为武器",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.tes-Name": "多功能步战车（特斯拉线圈）",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.tes-Strengths": "· 强势对抗：步兵、重甲单位、轻甲单位",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.tes-Weaknesses": "· 无法攻击飞行器",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.tigr-Attributes": "· 乘员：白虎卫士",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.tigr-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "搭乘一名白虎卫士的多功能步战车\n发射长程反装甲防空导弹",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.ifv.tigr-Name": "多功能步战车（白虎卫士）",
